---
description: .NET backend and test rules
globs: src/**/*.cs,tests/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

Use async end-to-end, CancellationToken, thin endpoints/hubs, Domain invariants, Application handlers, EF Core transactions, Dapper only for targeted reads, and Wolverine outbox for post-commit integration events. Add tests for authorization, idempotency, and failure paths.
